+    Unlike :func:`cast_spell` this skips the normal sorcery-speed/instant
+    timing check (miracle casts happen at draw time, outside normal timing),
+    but otherwise mirrors the cast pipeline: ``can_cast`` legality, target
+    choice/validation, mana payment (with rollback on failure), the
+    ``on_cast`` hook, and pushing a resolving :class:`StackObject`.
+
+    Note: cost reduction (``get_cost_reduction``) is intentionally NOT applied
+    to *alternative_cost* — unlike :func:`cast_spell`, an alternative cost such
